			*10,Bar,11,Flat Bar,12,Hex Bar,20,Wire Spool,21,Wire Cut,30,Coat Elect,40,Plate/Sheet,51,Strip,60,Tube,65,Pipe,66,Nipple,67,Elbow,68,Tee,69,Reducer,70,Fittings,71,Coupling,72,Flange,75,Fastener,80,Disk,90,Machined
		
