		*m: printout		&& Print out the Quote.
		*m: qbody		&& Builds the body of the Quote.
		*m: qdbsendto		&& Stores Information for SendQuote.
		*m: qdbtoquote		&& Look for QDB edit to copy to Quote12
		*m: reload
		*m: remove0		&& Removes the 0 when using STR().
		*m: saveqa		&& Saves and updates QA Quote.
		*m: setbtnadd		&& Set Buttons for adding.
		*m: setbtnnorm		&& Set buttons to normal, before adding.
		*m: unopen		&& Remove the open mark.
		*m: winfax
		*m: winfax32
		*p: aqrecn		&& Array holding records
		*p: confirmorder
		*p: firstadd		&& Is this the First Quote to add
		*p: firstrecadded		&& Saves the Record number of the first items added to the send list.  For proper name and phone.
		*p: fnqdbsendto
		*p: fnquote
		*p: fnquoteattach
		*p: fnquoteterms
		*p: openquoteddbc		&& This mopdule opened the DBC.
		*p: qrecn		&& Quoted record number.
		*p: quote		&& Name of Quote file made. -no extension-
		*p: quote0		&& Original Qoute name.
		*p: salesp		&& Sales Person Initail- see LOAD
		*p: sendquotes		&& Alias of Quotes used by the SendQuotes module.
	*</DefinedPropArrayMethod>

